OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 3 JAN
OL,4,G2130FMusic Planet
OL,5,     GKathryn Tickell presents three
OL,6,     Gtracks showcasing Bogota's rich
OL,7,     Gmusical landscape, handpicked by
OL,8,     Gavant-latin Colombian trio, Los
OL,9,     GPiranas.
OL,10,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,11,     GKate Molleson presents highlights
OL,12,     Gfrom sound festival in Aberdeen,
OL,13,     Gincluding music by Una Monaghan,
OL,14,     GRyan Gleave and Neil Luck, plus
OL,15,     Gthe latest new releases and Kola
OL,16,     GNikoladze.
OL,17,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,18,     GIsabelle Faust plays Dvorak's
OL,19,     Gcolourful, folk-inspired violin
OL,20,     Gconcerto. Andris Nelsons leads
OL,21,     Gthe Leipzig Gewandhaus Orchestra
OL,22,     Gin Sibelius's second symphony.
